## Pre-configured npm Scripts

Quick commands for common scenarios:

```bash
# Basic test runs
npm test                              # Run all tests in headless mode (serial)
npm run test:headed                   # Run all tests in headed mode

# Parallel execution
npm run test:parallel                 # 4 workers, headless mode
npm run test:parallel:headed          # 4 workers, headed mode

# Tag-based execution
npm run test:tags                     # Run @smoke tests (modify script for different tags)
npm run test:tags:headed              # @smoke tests in headed mode
npm run test:tags:parallel            # @smoke tests in parallel (4 workers)
npm run test:tags:parallel:headed     # @smoke tests in parallel, headed mode
```

