## Custom Command Examples

### Example 1: Run @regression tests with 2 workers in headed mode
```bash
cross-env HEADED=true CUCUMBER_TAGS="@regression" CUCUMBER_WORKERS=2 npm test
```

### Example 2: Run @smoke and @critical tests in series, headed mode
```bash
cross-env HEADED=true CUCUMBER_TAGS="@smoke and @critical" npm test
```

### Example 3: Run all tests except @wip with 4 workers, collect all traces
```bash
cross-env CUCUMBER_WORKERS=4 CUCUMBER_TAGS="not @wip" TRACE=all npm test
```

### Example 4: Run @performance tests in headed mode, capture all traces
```bash
cross-env HEADED=true CUCUMBER_TAGS="@performance" TRACE=all npm test
```

