## CI/CD Pipeline Usage

### Example: GitHub Actions
```yaml
- name: Run tests with tags and parallel
  env:
    HEADED: false
    CUCUMBER_TAGS: '@smoke and not @wip'
    CUCUMBER_WORKERS: 4
    TRACE: all
  run: npm test
```

### Example: GitLab CI
```yaml
test:
  script:
    - npm test
  variables:
    CUCUMBER_TAGS: "@smoke"
    CUCUMBER_WORKERS: "2"
```

