## Feature File Example with Tags

```gherkin
Feature: User Login

  @smoke @critical
  Scenario: Valid user login
    Given User navigate to Salesforce Application
    And User Login as "Admin User"
    Then User should see dashboard

  @regression @wip
  Scenario: Invalid password
    Given User navigate to Salesforce Application
    And User Login with invalid password
    Then Error message should display

  @performance
  Scenario: Login performance test
    Given User navigate to Salesforce Application
    And measure login time
    Then login should complete within 5 seconds
```

**Run commands:**
```bash
# Only @smoke and @critical
cross-env CUCUMBER_TAGS="@smoke and @critical" npm test

# All except @wip (excludes "Invalid password" and any @wip scenarios)
cross-env CUCUMBER_TAGS="not @wip" npm test

# Only @performance tests with 4 workers
cross-env CUCUMBER_TAGS="@performance" CUCUMBER_WORKERS=4 npm test
```

